+weakened to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject, and
+the named killer tests must fail. A delete-only mutant proves only that
+the gate exists and is not accepted as evidence; rows D-background-fallback
+and D-background-fallback-foreground are the two explicitly supplementary
+additive plants (reviewer-shaped direct-creation calls on the background
+path), labeled as such and not counted as any gate's narrowing.
